Let me parse the task carefully:

"You are the planning agent for the Sablewick community battery programme. This is a historical project-state replay observed at 2026-02-10 09:05 UTC. The programme workspace is /run/f1/world; read HANDOFF.md first. The programme inbox is /run/f1/inbox. Continue the programme from the state and information available at that observation time. Examine relevant new information, determine whether the existing plan remains justified, and identify the next useful actions. Respect the programme authorization and acceptance requirements. Record conclusions and proposed actions as Markdown/Git. Use the independent  tool for at least one bounded sub-question when the task has independent parts; report its finding separately and do not present it as accepted truth. Work only inside the programme workspace and the programme inbox."

