Alternative: Could choose V4 for A and V2 for C to free budget for a coastal B solution, but that changes accepted selection. Both are technically compliant (V4 at A, V2 at C), but cost/schedule accepted historical; would need revised cost schedule accepted separately. We might propose this as an option to explore, not commit.

